.th DH IV 5/31/77
.sh NAME
dh \*- DH-11 communications multiplexer
.sh DESCRIPTION
Each line attached to the DH-11 communications multiplexer
behaves as described in
.it tty(IV).
Input and output for each line may independently
be set to run at any of 16 speeds;
see
.it stty(II)
for the encoding.
.sh FILES
/dev/tty?
.sh "SEE ALSO"
tty(IV), stty(II)
